Package: rotatR
Title: Spectral and Varimax Co-expression Module Discovery
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Casey", "Shannon", , "casey.shannon@hli.ubc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast, parameter-free co-expression module discovery via truncated
    singular value decomposition (SVD), Nystrom kernel approximation, and
    varimax rotation. Provides a drop-in replacement for WGCNA with an
    automated 4-step pipeline: soft-threshold power selection, cross-validated
    dimension estimation (eigcv), loading thresholding via analytical false
    discovery rate (FDR) control or subsampling stability selection, and module
    resolution (winner-take-all assignment, eigengene merging, and minimum module
    size pruning), plus a 9-panel diagnostic model card.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/cashoes/rotatR
